{"product_id":"carte-blanche-the-new-james-bond-novel","title":"Carte Blanche: The New James Bond Novel","description":"\u003cp\u003e'The face of war is changing. The other side doesn't play by the rules much any more. There's thinking, in some circles, that we need to play by a different set of rules too ...' Fresh from Afghanistan, James Bond has been recruited to a new agency. Conceived in the post-9\/11 world, it operates independent of Five, Six and the MoD, its very existence deniable. Its aim: to protect the Realm, by any means necessary. The Night Action alert calls Bond from dinner with a beautiful woman. GCHQ has decrypted an electronic whisper about an attack scheduled for later in the week: casualties estimated in the thousands, British interests adversely affected. And 007 has been given carte blanche to do whatever it takes to fulfil his mission.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 150 x 227\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Jeffery Deaver\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781444716481\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 448\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45387097079961,"sku":"3RG9781444716481","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68231789b32d1_Carte_Blanche-_The_New_James_Bond_Novel_Jeffery_Deaver.jpg?v=1747151048","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/carte-blanche-the-new-james-bond-novel","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}